  "description": "Polly v8 resilience for OpenAI and Azure OpenAI API calls. Automatic retry with exponential backoff on 429 rate limits (respecting Retry-After), circuit breaker on sustained failures, per-request timeout, and optional hedging. Works with any OpenAI-compatible HTTP client via a simple DelegatingHandler.",
